					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "Example 2: Partial Inversion\n\nThis example is very similar to the previous example in that we mess a little with the color channels.\nThis time the take the test card from the Texture In node and we apply 1-x to the channels to invert them.\nNow we get a partial inversion as we are only inverting the red and blue channels."
					}
				},
